# 0.1.11 相对 0.1.10 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
added|zh|检测方法下拉默认选中「使用已有储存」：不联网、秒出结论，弹框显示与实际执行的方法保持一致
added|en|The method dropdown now defaults to "stored IPs": no network needed, instant results, and the method shown in the dialog always matches the one actually executed
added|zh|详情弹框升级为一站式检测台：选方法、选档位、执行检测在一个界面完成
added|en|The item dialog is now a one-stop detection panel: pick method, pick tier and run in one place
added|zh|「只测此方法」改为检测本主菜单下全部子项（一次性，不改默认设置），并先弹档位弹框选档
added|en|"Detect with method" now covers every item under the current menu (one-shot, defaults untouched), opening the tier dialog first
added|zh|头部新增「检测可用性」按钮（蓝描边，检测类语义色），一键检测本主菜单全部项目
added|en|New "detect availability" header button (blue outline, detection semantic color) covering the whole menu in one click
added|zh|guides 指南库引入 13 篇立项方案（统一同步层、网络弹性、日志可诊断性等），新增 NFR 基线表与操作反馈矩阵
added|en|Adopt 13 planning guides into the repo (sync layer, network resilience, diagnostics, etc.) plus an NFR baseline table and an operation-feedback matrix
fixed|zh|详情列表在写入/重检测/整批检测后立即刷新，不再停留在旧结论
fixed|en|The item list now refreshes immediately after apply, per-IP re-probe and batch detect, instead of showing stale results
fixed|zh|源拉取增加幂等重试（退避＋抖动）；轮预算账本与队列终态记录设上限，挂机不再无界增长
fixed|en|Source fetches gain idempotent retries (backoff with jitter); round-ledger and finished-task records get size caps
fixed|zh|日志落盘（1MB 轮转）与异常退出检测；检测档位弹框与结果刷新的多处交互缺口修复
fixed|en|File logging with rotation and abnormal-exit detection; several interaction gaps fixed in the tier dialog and result refresh
updated|zh|头部选择器回归纯默认设置并加「加速方法」标签；「检测全部」改名「按默认方法检测」；新增内容安全策略（CSP）
updated|en|The header selector is back to pure default-setting with an "acceleration method" tag; "detect all" renamed "detect with defaults"; a Content-Security-Policy was added
